  "as_of": "2018-05-24",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would allow regulations to impose review fees on notified foreign passport funds, supporting the broader Asia Region Funds Passport framework for cross-border funds.",
   "It would align the fee legislation with annual review dates for those funds and make each fund's operator responsible for paying any prescribed fee.",
   "The changes would start after both Royal Assent and the relevant companion legislation commenced, while preserving existing regulations governing review fees for other entities."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The statutory review-date definition would be updated to match the definition introduced through the funds passport legislation.",
   "Notified foreign passport funds would join the categories of entities liable for prescribed review fees.",
   "Fee regulations already in force immediately before commencement would continue to operate."
  ],
  "affected": "Notified foreign passport funds offering interests in Australia and their operators would be affected.",
